WEBVTT

00:13:59.708 --> 00:14:03.087
Bili smo vrlo naivni, barem ja, oko lijeka

00:14:03.087 --> 00:14:05.703
za bolest u Indiji, visceral leishmaniasis,

00:14:05.703 --> 00:14:07.354
za koju sam mislio, kada budem imao lijek,

00:14:07.354 --> 00:14:08.710
možemo otići i izbrisati bolest.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:11.290
Pa, trebala je injekcija

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.926
svakog dana, 10 dana.

00:14:12.926 --> 00:14:15.313
Trebalo je još tri godine više od očekivanja
da dođemo do toga,

00:14:15.313 --> 00:14:16.771
i onda nije bilo načina

00:14:16.771 --> 00:14:19.139
da to dođe tamo.

00:14:19.139 --> 00:14:20.358
Srećom, shvatili smo

00:14:20.358 --> 00:14:23.520
da ako ubijete pješčane muhe,

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.642
možete biti uspješni tamo,

00:14:25.642 --> 00:14:27.497
ali proveli smo pet godina,

00:14:27.497 --> 00:14:28.875
potratili pet godina,

00:14:28.875 --> 00:14:30.882
i oko 60 milijuna,